  "body": "Privately positioned behind a gated entry, this beautifully renovated 1970s character home offers a rare blend of soul, style and flexibility, just moments from Madills Farm, Kohimarama Beach, quality schools and an easy CBD commute.\r\n\r\nLush subtropical, Balinese-inspired gardens and wraparound decks create a relaxed, resort-style setting that feels worlds away from the city. Inside, polished timber floors, timber panel detailing and floor-to-ceiling windows bring warmth and natural light, while a feature spiral staircase adds architectural character and a gas fireplace keeps winter evenings cosy.\r\n\r\nThe renovated kitchen features a Miele gas cooktop, Bosch double oven, island bench and generous pantry, with multiple living zones flowing to the decks, a BBQ area and a covered outdoor lounge with firepit. Separate guest accommodation with its own entry adds valuable flexibility for teenagers, extended family, working from home or potential rental income.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Renovated 1970s weatherboard and concrete block character home\r\n\r\n• Private gated entry with subtropical, Balinese-inspired gardens\r\n\r\n• Wraparound decks, BBQ area and covered firepit lounge\r\n\r\n• Renovated kitchen with Miele gas cooktop and Bosch double oven\r\nPolished timber floors, spiral staircase and gas fireplace\r\nSeparate guest accommodation with its own entry\r\nMoments from Madills Farm, Kohimarama Beach, schools and transport",
